1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
A cozy connection puzzle. Watch the first garden come to life.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Connect all 16 tiles to the golden seed. Matching path openings carry the light through the garden.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,500
The source stays put. Begin with the paths around it, then work your way outward.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,500
A click or tap turns a tile clockwise. Watch the light respond as the connections change.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Undo restores the previous orientation. It counts as another turn, so use it when you need to retrace a move.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Right-click or Shift-click to rotate counterclockwise. A quarter turn can open a new path.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,500
A hint fixes one tile in the right direction and locks it in place. Each hint reduces your garden score by 180 points.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:34,900
Keep matching the path openings. The connected count shows your progress. Flowers bloom when the light reaches them.

9
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:38,700
There is no countdown. Pause stops the clock and gives you a moment to breathe.

10
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:49,500
Keep going until every tile is lit. These last turns join the lower paths and reach the final flower.

11
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:57,000
All 16 tiles now share the light. This demonstration used 17 turns and one hint.

12
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Continue to Fern hollow. Later gardens expand from 4 × 4 to 5 × 5 and 6 × 6 boards.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Bring your start.ng character. Grow a garden. Save your best run.
